# p_7e2a — Hana's notebook at the desk, tablet at the kitchen table, mug at the coffee table (fork of p_b8c2)

This is a fork of p_b8c2. The parent document placed both the tablet and the mug at desk_b1 during Hana's weekday morning work block (06:30–13:40). The sightings have now contradicted that placement decisively: tablet_hana was sighted at kitchen_table_k1 four times at 09:00 and at coffee_table_l1 twice at 10:00, but never at desk_b1 during the morning. The parent's tablet-at-desk claim has scored against 8 times and for 0. Similarly, mug_hana was sighted at coffee_table_l1 at 10:00, 13:00, and 17:00, and the mixture's worst-objects report flags two misses where the mug was predicted at cupboard_k1 but actually at coffee_table_l1.

What changed: the tablet_hana blocks now place it at kitchen_table_k1 (08:00–10:00 weekday) and coffee_table_l1 (10:00–12:00 weekday), falling back to nightstand_b1 otherwise. The mug_hana blocks now place it at coffee_table_l1 (10:00–17:00 both days) instead of desk_b1. The notebook_hana blocks are unchanged: the notebook stays at desk_b1 all day (confirmed 4/4 sighted days, single receptacle). The guitar, camera, yoga mat, and all other targets are carried over from the parent without modification.

What sets this apart from the parent: tablet_hana is NOT at desk_b1 in the morning; it is at kitchen_table_k1 (8–10h) then coffee_table_l1 (10–12h). The mug is at coffee_table_l1 during the day, not at the desk. What would refute it: tablet_hana sighted at desk_b1 between 08:00 and 12:00 on a weekday; mug_hana sighted at desk_b1 at any hour.

